	// Names are enforced by the sandbox's resolver, which is this host's: a
	// name a rule allows resolves, and what it resolves to is pinned open on
	// that rule's ports for as long as that rule's `pinTtl` says; a name no
	// rule allows does not resolve. A workload that dials a literal address
	// never asked the resolver, so nothing was pinned, so it is refused —
	// which is the property that makes a name-based allowlist mean anything.
