// SandboxState | state | what it means | what to do |
// |---|---|---|
// | `creating` | the image is being pulled, the disk made, the rules installed | wait, or read the events |
// | `booting` | the hypervisor is up, the guest has not answered | wait |
// | `ready` | the guest answers | use it |
// | `unreachable` | it was ready and is not answering now | retry; it may come back |
// | `paused` | frozen on purpose, its memory and processes kept | `POST /resume` |
